  :authoritative_for
  ["which GitHub org a new repo belongs in: any library (language or -clj infra) -> kotoba-lang / public-interest agent -> etzhayyim / commercial product -> gftdcojp / cloud+data -> com-junkawasaki"
   "the 公益=etzhayyim / 事業=gftdcojp split that library ADRs assert only inline"
